--- coverage_improvement_strategy
step | task | description | tools | output | priority
1 | Analyze Tests | Review existing tests for gaps | npm run test:cov, SonarQube | gap_analysis | high
2 | Identify Uncovered | Locate files, functions, branches not covered | Coverage reports | uncovered_areas | high
3 | Prioritize Modules | Focus on critical and business logic | Module analysis | priority_list | high
4 | Create Missing Tests | Implement tests for uncovered areas | Test framework | new_tests | high
5 | Validate Quality | Ensure tests are relevant and valuable | Code review | quality_check | medium
6 | Generate Report | Summarize improvements and new coverage % | Report generation | final_report | medium

--- coverage_goals_target
target_coverage | quality_gate | sonarqube_standard | current_goal | timeframe | priority
87% | B-2 | SonarQube Quality Gate | Minimum required | Sprint-based | critical
95% | A-1 | Industry best practice | Aspirational | Long-term | high
70% | C-1 | Baseline standard | Fallback minimum | Emergency | low
100% | Perfect | Theoretical maximum | Not practical | Never | impossible

--- test_creation_guidelines
guideline | applies_to | do | dont | reason
Quality_Focus | All tests | Create relevant tests | Avoid trivial tests | Business value
Original_Logic | Implementation | Keep existing logic intact | Modify code logic | Maintain functionality
Coverage_Only | Test creation | Test uncovered code | Test already covered code | Optimize effort
Avoid_Duplication | Test creation | Create comprehensive coverage | Duplicate existing tests | Prevent redundancy
Document_Value | Test cases | Explain test purpose | Leave undocumented | Maintainability

--- coverage_reporting_structure
section | content | description | includes
Covered_Areas | List of improved files | Files with significant improvements | File paths, coverage %
Test_Types_Added | Categorization | Unit, integration, e2e tests added | Count per type
Coverage_Percentage | Metric summary | Final coverage % achieved | Baseline vs Final
Quality_Metrics | Additional data | Code quality improvements | Performance metrics
Recommendations | Next steps | Suggestions for further improvement | Action items
